msgid "StatColours - colours for the numbers in the stats window."
msgstr "StatColours - colours for the numbers in the stats window."

msgid "Read once, when the game starts."
msgstr "Read once, when the game starts."

msgid "A colour is #RRGGBB, as in HTML. A value that makes no sense"
msgstr "A colour is #RRGGBB, as in HTML. A value that makes no sense"

msgid "is ignored, and a line about it goes to the RE_Kenshi log."
msgstr "is ignored, and a line about it goes to the RE_Kenshi log."

msgid "LevelN is the colour for skills from N to N+9. Level100 is"
msgstr "LevelN is the colour for skills from N to N+9. Level100 is"

msgid "exactly a hundred, Above100 is over it - which only happens"
msgstr "exactly a hundred, Above100 is over it - which only happens"

msgid "with a bonus from equipment."
msgstr "with a bonus from equipment."

msgid "The bracket with the equipment correction: (+3) or (-4)."
msgstr "The bracket with the equipment correction: (+3) or (-4)."

msgid "Brackets is the brackets themselves, Bonus and Penalty the"
msgstr "Brackets is the brackets themselves, Bonus and Penalty the"

msgid "number inside. BracketSide is which side of the value it"
msgstr "number inside. BracketSide is which side of the value it"

msgid "goes on: left or right. On the left it can overlap a long"
msgstr "goes on: left or right. On the left it can overlap a long"

msgid "skill name - then put right, where it is in nobody's way."
msgstr "skill name - then put right, where it is in nobody's way."

msgid "auto - take it from the game palette (kenshi_colours.xml),"
msgstr "auto - take it from the game palette (kenshi_colours.xml),"

msgid "that is, follow the interface theme and any mod over it."
msgstr "that is, follow the interface theme and any mod over it."

